[02:07.08]lavish [ˈlævɪʃ]a. 异常丰富的；无节制的；过分慷慨的； 浪费的 vt. 慷慨地给予；挥霍 例 He held a lavish party for the founding of his new company.
[02:18.60]enticing [ɪnˈtaɪsɪŋ]a. 迷人的；引诱的 例 We could imagine a great many buyers, since that's really an enticing offer.
