[03:58.68]conditional [kənˈdɪʃənl]a. 有条件的，有前提的；取决于…的 例 There are two forms of most-favoured- nation treatment: conditional and unconditional. 搭 be conditional upon/on 取决于…派 conditionality n. 条件限制；制约性
